name crumbs
category Package
revision 64602
shortdesc Add a Navigation Path to the page header
relocated 1
longdesc This package adds a navigation path ("breadcrumb trail") at the
longdesc header of a presentation, just like some websites do in order
longdesc to simplify navigation.
depend catchfile
depend etoolbox
depend xkeyval
runfiles size=2
